        "TileImage": "$($repository 3420a8a5-bf9b-4376-b2a0-943aaaaff85d).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued, and you have been cleared to engage. Our client has been made aware of three bad actors planning to carry out a coordinated assassination on her after the illegal auction upstairs.\rMarc Eunuque keeps an eye on her upstairs, signalling to the others once the auction has ended. Courtland Auprey will then cause a distraction on the runway and in the confusion Luc Tessier will assassinate her and dispose of the body in the river. But we wont let that happen. Good luck 47.",
